an-empire">Romans</a></span></li><li><span class="rf-year">1563</span><span class="rf-text">Frederick III issues the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/heidelberg-catechism">Heidelberg Catechism</a></span></li><li><span class="rf-year">1619</span><span class="rf-text"><a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/frederick-v-of-the-palatinate">Frederick V</a> accepts the crown of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/bohemia">Bohemia</a></span></li><li><span class="rf-year">1689</span><span class="rf-text">French troops burn <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/heidelberg">Heidelberg</a> and <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/mannheim">Mannheim</a> in the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/nine-years-war-ireland">Nine Years' War</a></span></li><li><span class="rf-year">1803</span><span class="rf-text">The <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/reichsdeputationshauptschluss">Imperial Recess</a> divides the remaining lands among <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/baden">Baden</a> and others</span></li></ol>
